{"seq":2,"slug":"data-layer","title":"数据层多租户","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"database-per-tenant","title":"独立数据库模式（Database-per-Tenant）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/database-per-tenant","wordCount":1379,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-per-tenant","title":"独立 Schema 模式（Schema-per-Tenant）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/schema-per-tenant","wordCount":1180,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"row-level-security","title":"行级安全隔离（Row-Level Security）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/data-layer/row-level-security","wordCount":1109,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据层多租户\">数据层多租户</h1><p>本章深入数据持久化层的多租户实现，逐一拆解三种隔离模型在数据库层面的工程落地细节。每种模型对应一篇独立文档：独立数据库（Database-per-Tenant）、独立 Schema（Schema-per-Tenant）、以及行级安全（Row-Level Security）。</p>\n<p>三种模型并非简单的「好与坏」关系，而是在隔离强度、运维成本、资源利用率、租户上限等维度上形成一组连续的权衡空间。实际生产系统常采用混合策略——对高价值企业客户使用独立数据库，对中小租户使用行级安全。</p>\n<p>完成本章后，读者应能为每种模型写出生产级的实现方案（含连接管理、迁移策略、备份恢复），并理解何时该从一种模型迁移到另一种。</p>\n"}